    "name": "Dartmour: Tablets of the Ancients",
    "steam_appid": 3752140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dartmour is a medieval fantasy open-world RPG set in the vast world of Korden Sau, where ancient magic and warring kingdoms intertwine. As a wanderer in the kingdom of Dartmour, one of many, you forge your path amid rival factions and untold mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Magic System</strong>: Wield ambient magic through chants and staves, mastering schools like fire or levitation. Magic is potent but unpredictable, tied to mysterious forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living World</strong>: NPCs act independently\u2014trading, plotting, responding to your deeds. Your choices shape rumors, quests, and regional economies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Ambition</strong>: Rise from nothing to power broker, dealing in coins and crystals. Own taverns, smuggle goods, or ally with factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent Quests</strong>: Explore varied regions, from the rolling meadows of the south to the glacier walls of the north, with quests shaped by local folklore and your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Foes</strong>: Confront orcs, wraiths, or cursed beasts, each tied to Korden Sau\u2019s storied past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Creation</strong>: Select from seven races, define your origins, and evolve through meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Lore</strong>: Uncover the roots of magic and the world\u2019s ancient secrets through exploration and wit.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dartmour is a medieval fantasy open-world RPG set in the vast world of Korden Sau, where ancient magic and warring kingdoms intertwine. As a wanderer in the kingdom of Dartmour, one of many, you forge your path amid rival factions and untold mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Magic System</strong>: Wield ambient magic through chants and staves, mastering schools like fire or levitation. Magic is potent but unpredictable, tied to mysterious forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living World</strong>: NPCs act independently\u2014trading, plotting, responding to your deeds. Your choices shape rumors, quests, and regional economies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic Ambition</strong>: Rise from nothing to power broker, dealing in coins and crystals. Own taverns, smuggle goods, or ally with factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent Quests</strong>: Explore varied regions, from the rolling meadows of the south to the glacier walls of the north, with quests shaped by local folklore and your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Foes</strong>: Confront orcs, wraiths, or cursed beasts, each tied to Korden Sau\u2019s storied past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Creation</strong>: Select from seven races, define your origins, and evolve through meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Lore</strong>: Uncover the roots of magic and the world\u2019s ancient secrets through exploration and wit.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dartmour is an open-world RPG in a vast medieval fantasy world of warring kingdoms and magic. As a wanderer in Dartmour, forge your path amid factions and mysteries. Wield unpredictable magic, sharp sword, or sharper tongue, trade or smuggle, fight mythic foes, and uncover deep lore.",
